Account Running Low on Seats

Your Firezone account "<%= @account.slug %>" (<%= @account.id %>) is almost out of monthly active seats.

Monthly active users: <%= @active_users_count %> / <%= @seats_limit %>
Seats remaining: <%= @seats_remaining %>

What happens next?
When all seats are used, new users cannot be enabled. If the number of monthly active users goes over your seat count, client sign ins and connections are blocked until you add seats or the count drops.

To add seats, go to Settings -> Billing (<%= @billing_url %>) in the admin portal and click the "Manage plan" button.

You will get this reminder at most once a week while seats are running low. If you have any questions, please contact our support team.

Thanks,
The Firezone Team
